<br /><span style="font-size: 10pt;"><strong>CLAIMS MANAGEMENT SOLUTION</strong><br /><br />Cargoclaims CCLP platform offers a full digital cargo claims management solution for airlines and GS(S)a's.<br />The online claims platform provides a customer friendly access tool and offers airlines a state of the art solution to manage claims in a transparent and efficient manner.&nbsp;<br /><br /><img src="https://cargohub.aero/vich/b8d7d53e3c01a41ad6e825efda028891c7a6d3ba" width="825" height="461" /><br /></span><span style="font-size: 10pt;"><strong><br /></strong><img src="https://cargohub.aero/vich/328451d6eed81342efc11db0fe0abc2e4e0ec46f" width="826" height="458" /><br /><br /><br /><img src="https://cargohub.aero/vich/a333385658dbb37a5d990b3b04a6e629c321cc7c" width="825" height="464" /><br /><br /><img src="https://cargohub.aero/vich/2b510503b08974f98d8132a5190b72a85fb5346f" width="827" height="466" /><br /><br /><br /><img src="https://cargohub.aero/vich/c5f27465714d852887cc15667e356d2271dcdaa1" width="826" height="455" /><br /><br /><br /></span><span style="font-size: 10pt;"><strong><br />(CCLP) CARGO CLAIMS AND LOSS PREVENTION PROGRAM</strong><br /><br />The full CCLP program combined both the loss prevention and claims management program for airlines. Damage reports and loss prevention insights will be instantly available in the airlines handling system to support the claims handling process and to reduce the claim recovery cycle.&nbsp;<br /><br />In order to enable airlines to effectively organize their customer services, loss prevention and claims management process, it is required for handling companies to report service recovery issues as quickly as possible to their airline customers.<br /><br />Handling companies whom are operating the CCLP program will actively contribute to the airlines loss prevention program and at the same time will increase the quality of their handling service. [see CCLP program for handlers]<br /><br /><br /><img src="https://cargohub.aero/vich/bf2a30a3721f02e6e4dba371c3c53b09be76f867" width="826" height="461" /><br /><br /><br /><br /><strong><br /></strong><br /><br /><br /><img src="https://cargohub.aero/vich/28b79cae376299779539140c01cadffaf1e8cef6" width="836" height="356" /><br /></span></div>
